    "https://careers-ieedu.icims.com/jobs/3128/executive-director%2c-imba---business-school/job": {
      "title": "Executive Director, IMBA - Business School",
      "description": "Executive Director, IMBA - Business School in Madrid | Careers at Madrid Skip to Main Content Please Enable Cookies to Continue Please enable cookies in your browser to experience all the personalized features of this site, including the ability to apply for a job. Welcome page Returning Candidate? Log back in! Executive Director, IMBA - Business School Job Locations ES-Madrid Posted Date 1 month ago (21/07/2026 12:13) Job ID 2026-3128 # of Openings 1 Overview Are you interested in joining a dynamic and international team of professionals to transform education? IE University's Business School is looking for an Executive Director – Program Experience for IMBA to join its team! The Executive Director of Program Experience for the International MBA (IMBA) is responsible for ensuring academic and operational excellence across the program. This role oversees program operations, student and faculty engagement, and the successful implementation of strategic initiatives focused on enhancing the overall student experience and program quality. We are seeking a highly skilled and innovative leader to manage a team of around 13 professionals dedicated to delivering outstanding service to students and faculty. The Executive Director will play a key role in driving operational excellence, leading high-impact strategic initiatives, and ensuring seamless execution across all areas of the IMBA experience. This role reports directly to the Director of Experience & Transformation for Full-Time Programs and works closely with the Vice Dean of the IMBA, sharing responsibility for program delivery, operational effectiveness, and continuous improvement. Why IE University? Every story begins with a purpose, and ours has always been about people. Founded in 1973, IE University has continuously raised the bar to drive positive change through education. We believe education is more than a path to professional success; it is a catalyst for personal transformation and meaningful impact. At IE University, we place people and their potential at the center of everything we do, empowering individuals to become extraordinary. We encourage bold thinking and foster a culture where innovation, curiosity, and courage lead to real-world impact. Together, we create an environment where talent thrives, and ideas shape the future. Our mission We support students in developing impact skills to live and lead with positive impact. This ignites a ripple effect: We transform people, who then transform others, systems, society, and, ultimately, our world. Our Purpose To foster positive change. Values Cultivate the humanistic approach. Empower your entrepreneurial spirit Cherish the diversity of people, mind, and experience Drive innovation with a proactive mindset We are looking for a person to join a full-time position in Madrid, María de Molina. Responsibilities Your role as a Executive Director will involve: Lead, manage, and inspire a team of professionals to ensure exceptional service delivery to students and faculty. Oversee the day-to-day operations and execution of the IMBA program, ensuring a high-quality and seamless student experience. Develop and implement initiatives aimed at improving student engagement, satisfaction, and overall program quality. Lead and coordinate large-scale strategic and operational projects across the program lifecycle. Ensure effective allocation of tasks and resources to meet deadlines and maintain quality standards. Drive the implementation of transformation and continuous improvement initiatives within the program. Foster collaboration, accountability, and innovation within the team and across cross-functional stakeholders. Monitor and evaluate team performance, providing feedback, coaching, and development opportunities. Collaborate closely with senior management and academic leadership to align program operations with the Business School’s strategic priorities. Oversee thestudent journey from onboarding through graduation, ensuring operational excellence at every stage. Qualifications To thrive in this role, you should possess the following qualifications: Bachelor’s degree (required); MBA or equivalent advanced degree preferred. Fully bilingual in Spanish and English (written and spoken). Proven leadership and team management skills, with the ability to motivate, develop, and inspire others. Strong orientation toward service excellence and student-centric solutions. Demonstrated experience leading complex, large-scale strategic or operational projects. Strong project management and organizational skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities effectively. Strategic mindset with a strong focus on execution and continuous improvement. Excellent interpersonal and communication skills, including collaboration and stakeholder management. Ability to work effectively in fast-paced and international environments. Budget management expertise . Experience managing multidisciplinary teams in complex organizations. Familiarity with higher education, MBA programs, or student services environments is highly desirable. Experience implementing operational improvement or transformation initiatives is a plus. Unleash your full potential and make an impact. The next move is yours! If you want to be part of this educational revolution, we invite you to apply and be part of our dynamic team at IE University. At IE University, we actively promote equal opportunities in recruitment processes and access to employment, always ensuring the absence of gender, sexual orientation, religion, age, ethnic origin, or disability bias throughout the entire selection process. Options Apply for this job online Apply Share Sorry the Share function is not working properly at this moment. Please refresh the page and try again later. Share on your newsfeed Join Our Talent Community! Looking for an amazing career opportunity, but just not seeing exactly what you want? We are always looking for top talent and we are interested in connecting with you in the future! Application FAQs Software Powered by ICIMS www.icims.com https://careers-ieedu.icims.com/jobs/3128/executive-director%2c-imba---business-school/job?in_iframe=1 4"
